child (all pages) and applies is_mark() here: Drive's name-contains search matches word prefixes only, so a
suffix like Analysis.Rproj cannot be searched for (Codex r2 F1, r4 F1)."""
for i in range(0, len(ids), BATCH):
    token, seen = None, set()
    while True:
        p = {"q": parents_q(ids[i:i + BATCH]), "pageSize": 1000,
             "fields": "nextPageToken,incompleteSearch,files(id,name,mimeType)"}
        if token:
            p["pageToken"] = token
        got = page(gws(["list", "--params", json.dumps(p)]), seen)
        if got is None:
            return None
        files, token = got
        if any(is_mark(x["name"]) for x in files):
            return True
        if not token:
            break
        seen.add(token)
return False

